## Bundled data

Card and set data, including the functional fingerprints and regulation marks,
are derived from **TCGdex** (<https://tcgdex.dev>), whose card database is
licensed MIT (<https://github.com/tcgdex/cards-database>). The derivation is
documented in the repository's spec; card text and images are not redistributed.

Archetype aliases and sprite slugs are derived from **Limitless TCG**
(<https://limitlesstcg.com>) and are included as attributed community
identifiers. The checked-in table is a snapshot of the current and previous
format windows. No card images or card text from Limitless are redistributed.

